    {
      "text": "dynamics: ¨x = −αy + x −x3 + γ cos(ωt), with states x, y ∈R and parameters α, γ, ω ∈R. This",
      "bbox": [
        89.99998474121094,
        586.7800903320312,
        521.99560546875,
        600.6653442382812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
