        614.2153930664062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "certain values of α, γ and ω, for instance α = 0.05, γ = 0.4, ω = 1.3. The set of initial states is",
      "bbox": [
        90.00003051757812,
